{"sha": "b825eccb4724a8e7be7771a806b5404559cb1093015c5ee2a7895a85e6aef1a0", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:deriv} 章 --- 导数：入门教程}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:1}", "对 $f(x) = x^2$，取 $a = 2$：", "\\[", "\\frac{(2+h)^2 - 4}{h} = \\frac{4h + h^2}{h} = 4 + h", "\\xrightarrow[h\\to0]{} 4,", "\\]", "于是 $f'(2) = 4$。对 $g(x) = x^2 + 3x$，取 $a = 1$，$g(1) = 4$，且", "\\[", "\\frac{(1+h)^2 + 3(1+h) - 4}{h} = \\frac{5h + h^2}{h} = 5 + h", "\\xrightarrow[h\\to0]{} 5,", "\\]", "于是 $g'(1) = 5$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:2}", "$f'(x) = 12x^2 - 4x + 1$.", "", "$g'(x) = \\frac{5}{2\\sqrt x} - \\frac{3}{x^2}$（在 $\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 上）。", "", "$h'(x) = 2(x^2 - 3) + (2x+1)(2x) = 2x^2 - 6 + 4x^2 + 2x", "= 6x^2 + 2x - 6$（由乘积法则）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:3}", "$f(x) = x^2 - 3x$，$a = 2$：$f(2) = -2$，$f'(x) = 2x - 3$，故 $f'(2) = 1$；", "切线 $y = -2 + (x - 2) = x - 4$。", "", "$f(x) = \\frac1x$，$a = 1$：$f(1) = 1$，$f'(1) = -1$；切线", "$y = 1 - (x - 1) = 2 - x$。", "", "$f(x) = \\sqrt x$，$a = 4$：$f(4) = 2$，$f'(4) = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt4} =", "\\frac14$；切线 $y = 2 + \\frac14(x - 4) = \\frac{x}{4} + 1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:4}", "$f'(x) = \\frac{(x-1) - (x+2)}{(x-1)^2} = \\frac{-3}{(x-1)^2}$.", "", "$g'(x) = \\frac{2x(x^2+1) - x^2 \\times 2x}{(x^2+1)^2}", "= \\frac{2x}{(x^2+1)^2}$.", "", "$h'(x) = -\\frac{2x+1}{(x^2+x+1)^2}$（由商的求导法则，取 $u = 1$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:5}", "$f'(x) = 3x^2 - 12x + 9 = 3(x^2 - 4x + 3) = 3(x-1)(x-3)$：", "在 $\\intcc{1}{3}$ 之外为正，在其内为负。故 $f$ 在", "$\\intoc{-\\infty}{1}$ 上递增，在 $\\intcc{1}{3}$ 上递减，在", "$\\intco{3}{+\\infty}$ 上递增，有极大值 $f(1) = 1 - 6 + 9 - 2 = 2$，", "极小值为 $f(3) = 27 - 54 + 27 - 2 = -2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:6}", "在 $\\intoo{-1}{+\\infty}$ 上：", "\\[", "f'(x) = \\frac{2x(x+1) - (x^2+3)}{(x+1)^2}", "= \\frac{x^2 + 2x - 3}{(x+1)^2}", "= \\frac{(x+3)(x-1)}{(x+1)^2}.", "\\]", "当 $x > -1$ 时，$x + 3$ 与 $(x+1)^2$ 均为正，故 $f'(x)$ 与", "$x - 1$ 同号：$f$ 在 $\\intoc{-1}{1}$ 上递减，在 $\\intco{1}{+\\infty}$ 上递增，", "且最小值为 $f(1) = \\frac{4}{2} = 2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:7}", "$f'(x) = 2x - 4$.", "", "\\emph{1.} 水平切线：令 $f'(x) = 0$，得 $x = 2$；切点为", "$(2, f(2)) = (2, 1)$（抛物线的顶点）。", "", "\\emph{2.} 与 $y = 2x + 1$ 平行，即斜率为 $2$：$2x - 4 = 2$，故", "$x = 3$，切点为 $(3, f(3)) = (3, 2)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:8}", "设宽为 $x$（有围栏的两边），长为 $60 - 2x$：", "$A(x) = x(60 - 2x) = 60x - 2x^2$，定义在 $\\intoo{0}{30}$ 上。于是", "$A'(x) = 60 - 4x$，在 $x = 15$ 之前为正，之后为负，故面积", "在 $x = 15$ 时最大，此时围成一块 $15 \\times 30$ m 的围场，面积为", "$450$ m$^2$。由\\cref{ch:g11:quad}中的顶点公式", "$\\alpha = -\\frac{60}{2 \\times (-2)} = 15$ 可得同样结果，无需微积分。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:9}", "设 $f(x) = \\frac{x+1}{2} - \\sqrt x$，定义在 $\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 上。则", "\\[", "f'(x) = \\frac12 - \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt x} = \\frac{\\sqrt x - 1}{2\\sqrt x},", "\\]", "其符号与 $\\sqrt x - 1$ 相同：在 $\\intoo{0}{1}$ 上为负，", "在 $\\intoo{1}{+\\infty}$ 上为正。故 $f$ 先递减后递增，最小值为", "$f(1) = 1 - 1 = 0$。因此 $f(x) \\geq 0$ 对所有 $x > 0$ 成立，即", "$\\sqrt x \\leq \\frac{x+1}{2}$，且仅当 $x = 1$ 时取等号。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:10}", "由 $\\pi r^2 h = 500$，得 $h = \\frac{500}{\\pi r^2}$，故", "\\[", "S(r) = 2\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi r \\cdot \\frac{500}{\\pi r^2}", "= 2\\pi r^2 + \\frac{1000}{r},", "\\qquad", "S'(r) = 4\\pi r - \\frac{1000}{r^2}.", "\\]", "当 $S'(r) = 0$ 时，$4\\pi r^3 = 1000$，即 $r^3 = \\frac{250}{\\pi}$，故", "$r = \\sqrt[3]{250/\\pi}$（$\\approx 4.3$ cm）。由于 $S'(r) =", "\\frac{4\\pi r^3 - 1000}{r^2}$ 在此值之前为负，之后为正，", "故此点为极小值点。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:deriv:11}", "曲线 $y = x^2$ 在横坐标为 $a$ 的点处的切线为", "$y = a^2 + 2a(x - a) = 2ax - a^2$。该切线经过 $P(1, -3)$ 的条件是", "$-3 = 2a - a^2$，即 $a^2 - 2a - 3 = 0$，其根为 $a = 3$ 与", "$a = -1$（$\\Delta = 16$）。因此过", "$P$ 恰有 \\emph{两}条切线：", "\\[", "y = 6x - 9 \\quad (a = 3),", "\\qquad", "y = -2x - 1 \\quad (a = -1).", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", ""]}